vision.</strong></p><p>Our design team work with you with one goal in mind: to exceed your expectations. They will be involved at all levels of the design and production processes for your <a href="/water-features/">custom water feature</a>, starting with the blank canvas to capture your vision and design intent until the until is completely and working. With Midwest Tropical, you will receive:</p><ul><li><p>AutoCAD drawings that specify the components, finishes, and exact dimensions of your water feature.</p></li><li><p>Expert recommendations on materials that fit your budget and design intent with a complete budget analysis to help you understand the costs.</p></li><li><p>Timely updates, including photos, from your project manager throughout the production process to help you build excitement among your team or clients and to visualize your finished product.</p></li><li><p>Fabrication in our state-of-the-art manufacturing facility where we also test your water feature to ensure that all of the components (pump, filtration, lighting, water flow and acoustics) properly work together.</p></li><li><p>Delivery with your custom water feature packaged in a custom shipping container to ensure full protection.</p></li><li><p>and your project manager will work closely with you to schedule shipping and an installation time line that works best for you.</p></li></ul><p><a href="/contact-us-2/">Contact us</a> today to conceptualize your ideas and learn about our range of abilities for creating statement installations for everything from residential and small businesses to healthcare, hospitality, and more.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-43f205f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="43f205f" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-25 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3bc8abc" data-id="3bc8abc" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0db4365 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="0db4365" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default"><div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/AutoCAD-100x100.png.webp 100w, /wp-content/uploads/AutoCAD-150x101.png.webp 150w, /wp-content/uploads/AutoCAD.png 188w" type="image/webp"><img decoding="async" width="188" height="126" src="/wp-content/uploads/AutoCAD.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-99198" alt="AutoCAD" title="DESIGN PROCESS 1" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/AutoCAD-100x100.png 100w, /wp-content/uploads/AutoCAD-150x101.png 150w, /wp-content/uploads/AutoCAD.png 188w" sizes="(max-width: 188px) 100vw, 188px" data-mtfi="1" /></picture></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title">AutoCAD Drawings</h3></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-25 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-43391e7" data-id="43391e7" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bb88cae elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="bb88cae" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default"><div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" width="105" height="159" src="/wp-content/uploads/ExpertRecomendations.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-99202" alt="" title="DESIGN PROCESS 2" srcset="/wp-content/u